Package: mcma
Title: Bayesian Misclassification-Corrected Meta-Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
URL: https://github.com/jmfawcet/mcma
Authors@R: c(
    person("Jonathan M.", "Fawcett", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "jfawcett@mun.ca",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-4248-5371")),
    person("Jedidiah", "Whitridge", role = c("aut"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1237-4977"))
  )
Description: Implements the Bayesian misclassification-corrected meta-analysis
    workflow. Wraps 'brms' to provide convenient functions for constructing
    corrected prevalence models, specifying sensitivity/specificity priors from
    external evidence, running sensitivity analyses, and estimating Se/Sp from
    gold-standard data via discrete kernel-weighted grid averaging (KWGA) or joint modeling.
